<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian money market supply raised in week.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian money market supply raised in week.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank said it added liquidity to the money market in the week to August 4 due to autonomous factors.</p>
<p>(figures from the weekly statement in bln francs) -</p>
<p> Foreign currency reserves	   454.010 (+  0.883)</p>
<p> Advances against pledged security  17.246 (-  4.065)</p>
<p> Commercial bills			  2.101 (+  0.000)</p>
<p> Securities portfolio		   22.792 (-  0.002)</p>
<p> Money market interventions*	 106.653 (+  8.791)</p>
<p> Bank notes in circulation	   468.969 (-  1.805)</p>
<p>* comprises repurchase agreements and interbank loans</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
